msgid "These are actual stored snapshots, not reconstructed past prices. Demonstration observations record invented demo prices at command execution time; they do not represent real marketplace history. Illustrative sample price changes may be captured within one command run; they do not show an elapsed market trend or continuous monitoring. Delivery and discounts are excluded. Product associations are unverified."
